ian didn't think that the recipes would be hard to follow. I told her about my idea to do a cleanse. She didn't feel like it was a good idea to cut out coffee. I think she's crazy about coffee. <br />", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "38500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\nThat's a good idea getting a cookbook! I like your enthusiasm. Did you talk to Amy about helping you with some of the recipes? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\nYes, I did. She didn't believe that I was going to do a cleanse. She thinks that I'm too addicted to sugar and fat, thus I will not be able to go without them. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\nBut that's the whole point of doing a cleanse. Did you explain it to her? We have to completely eliminate these unhealthy foods or else we cannot break our addictions", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le07ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "68000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\nYes, I explained it to her in more detail. Consequently, she wants to try it too. She wants to support me. However, she didn't expect that she would be able to help with the cooking.  She says she can't cook the meals that I will need to eat! <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\nReally? I thought she was a pretty good cook. I'm surprised that she said that. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\nShe likes to cook with meat and butter and salt and cheese, all the things I have to forgo. She felt that she wouldn't be a good vegan cook. <br /><span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\nI'm sure you'll figure something out.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le07ob03re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le07ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}